      {
       "name": "Breaker",
       "url": "pfsrd://Advanced Players Guide/Rules/Core Classes/Barbarian/Barbarian Archetypes/Breaker",
       "source": "Advanced Player's Guide",
       "type": "class_archetype",
       "subtype": "barbarian",
       "body": "<p>While most barbarians are skilled at breaking things, some find the need to destroy their surroundings. A breaker barbarian has the following class features.</p>",
       "sections": [
        {
         "name": "Destructive",
         "url": "pfsrd://Advanced Players Guide/Rules/Core Classes/Barbarian/Barbarian Archetypes/Breaker/Destructive",
         "source": "Advanced Player's Guide",
         "type": "ability",
         "ability_types": {
          "ability_type": "Extraordinary"
         },
         "body": "<p>Whenever the breaker barbarian makes a sunder combat maneuver, she adds half her barbarian level on the damage roll. This ability replaces fast movement.</p>"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "Paladin",
   "url": "pfsrd://Advanced Players Guide/Rules/Core Classes/Paladin",
   "source": "Advanced Player's Guide",
   "type": "section",
   "body": "<p>Paladin options.</p>",
   "sections": [
    {
     "name": "Antipaladin",
     "url": "pfsrd://Advanced Players Guide/Rules/Core Classes/Paladin/Antipaladin",
     "source": "Advanced Player's Guide",
     "type": "section",
     "body": "<p>Antipaladins are the dark mirror.</p>",
     "sections": [
      {
       "name": "Class Skills",
       "url": "pfsrd://Advanced Players Guide/Rules/Core Classes/Paladin/Antipaladin/Class Skills",
       "source": "Advanced Player's Guide",
       "type": "class_archetype",
       "subtype": "paladin",
       "body": "<p>The antipaladin's class skills are Bluff, Climb, and Intimidate.</p>"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
